	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Whether through carefully crafted speeches or a few meaningful words you are able to inspire others to greatness. By using your bonus action and expending 1 exertion, you grant a creature one of the following benefits: inspiration, expertise on a chosen skill or ability check for 1 minute, or you may improve their attitude by one step for 1 minute if they are not engaged in combat. Creatures can only benefit from this once per long rest.</p>",
